import{_ as t,o as i,c as n,a2 as a}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const p=JSON.parse(`{"title":"Entry 725 | Transcended-Ones' Perpetual-Construction System | Perpetual Construction and the 20% Activation Strategy","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 725 | Transcended-Ones' Perpetual-Construction System | Perpetual Construction and the 20% Activation Strategy","no":725,"module":4,"tags":["Perpetual Construction","20% Activation Strategy","Backbone Ranks","Myriad-Rank Uplift","20%-vs-80%"],"related":["23-20%-Activation Strategy Plan","75-20%-Activation Strategy Implementation","17-Plane-Transcendent Strong-One Standards"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0725_模块4-永动建设与20％激活战略.md","filePath":"en/0725_模块4-永动建设与20％激活战略.md"}`),o={name:"en/0725_模块4-永动建设与20％激活战略.md"};function r(s,e,l,h,c,u){return i(),n("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[a('<h1 id="entry-725-transcended-ones-perpetual-construction-system-perpetual-construction-and-the-20-activation-strategy" tabindex="-1">Entry 725 | Transcended-Ones&#39; Perpetual-Construction System | Perpetual Construction and the 20% Activation Strategy <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-725-transcended-ones-perpetual-construction-system-perpetual-construction-and-the-20-activation-strategy" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 725 | Transcended-Ones&#39; Perpetual-Construction System | Perpetual Construction and the 20% Activation Strategy&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 4 · Transcendence Orthodox Definition Library | Benchmark base: Documents 23, 75, 17</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-20-is-not-privilege-it-is-responsibility" tabindex="-1">Introduction: 20% is not privilege, it is responsibility <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-20-is-not-privilege-it-is-responsibility" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: 20% is not privilege, it is responsibility&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The 20% Activation Strategy is a high-frequency term in Heng Yuan Zhou. Its original meaning: at the early stage of civilizational establishment, activate 20% of beings to the plane-transcendent strong-one level, as a backbone driving the remaining 80% to jointly uplift. This entry makes clear: <strong>this 20% is not a chosen favorite, but a chosen builder.</strong> The perpetual-construction system and the 20% Activation Strategy are two sides of the same thing — the 20% is the backbone, and the backbone&#39;s way of working is perpetual construction.</p><p>Six top-level axioms in this entry converge into the word &quot;backbone&quot;: the republican axiom of Myriad Races requires the 20% activation be a means, not an end; the end is 99%-clan full coverage; the collective ascension axiom is directly the 20% strategy&#39;s parent law; the anti-predation axiom requires this 20% not be activated by predation; the causal self-discipline axiom requires the activation process not disturb Myriad Ranks&#39; natural rhythm; the law-first axiom requires the 20% ratio, paths, and assessment standards be stable.</p><p>The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-the-three-layer-structure-of-the-20-activation-strategy" tabindex="-1">I. The Three-Layer Structure of the 20% Activation Strategy <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-the-three-layer-structure-of-the-20-activation-strategy" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. The Three-Layer Structure of the 20% Activation Strategy&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Per Documents 23 and 75, the 20% Activation Strategy is not a vague number; it has a three-layer structure:</p><h3 id="_1-1-short-term-1-seed-period" tabindex="-1">1.1 Short Term: 1% Seed Period <a class="header-anchor" href="#_1-1-short-term-1-seed-period" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;1.1 Short Term: 1% Seed Period&quot;">​</a></h3><p>At the early stage of civilizational establishment, activate 1% of beings to the Origin Realm. This 1% is the first-generation anchors, the first batch of transcended ones, Lin Hao&#39;s generation. Their task is not to enjoy privilege, but <strong>to make the road passable</strong> — run the 300-set system smoothly, build the Selfless-Dao public library, erect the nine posts&#39; prototype.</p><h3 id="_1-2-mid-term-10-expansion-period" tabindex="-1">1.2 Mid Term: 10% Expansion Period <a class="header-anchor" href="#_1-2-mid-term-10-expansion-period" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;1.2 Mid Term: 10% Expansion Period&quot;">​</a></h3><p>After the 1% seeds make the paths passable, activate 10% of beings to the Origin Realm. This 10% is the backbone ranks, beginning to hold the nine posts&#39; formal work, beginning to cultivate the next generation of seeds, beginning to enlarge the Myriad-Origin two-way cycle&#39;s flow.</p><h3 id="_1-3-long-term-20-steady-state-period" tabindex="-1">1.3 Long Term: 20% Steady-State Period <a class="header-anchor" href="#_1-3-long-term-20-steady-state-period" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;1.3 Long Term: 20% Steady-State Period&quot;">​</a></h3><p>20% of beings reach the Origin Realm; civilization enters steady state. This 20% is the nine posts&#39; personnel pool — Maintenance Post, Guidance Post, Supervision Post... all posts select from this pool. The remaining 80% of beings, under this 20%&#39;s support, cultivate, live, and participate in civilization at their own rhythm.</p><h2 id="ii-the-meshing-of-20-and-perpetual-construction" tabindex="-1">II. The Meshing of 20% and Perpetual Construction <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-the-meshing-of-20-and-perpetual-construction" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. The Meshing of 20% and Perpetual Construction&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The 20% Activation Strategy and the perpetual-construction system are not two independent projects; they mesh:</p><ul><li>Perpetual construction is the 20% transcended ones&#39; <strong>way of working</strong>;</li><li>The 20% activation is perpetual construction&#39;s <strong>personnel-scale goal</strong>.</li></ul><p>Without the 20% personnel scale, perpetual construction is only a few first-generation anchors working; the scale cannot rise. Without the perpetual-construction way of working, the 20% strong ones are only 20% &quot;retired elders&quot;; even if the scale rises, it is useless.</p><p>The two together are Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s complete answer to &quot;Myriad-Rank uplift&quot;: <strong>cultivate 20% willing to perpetually-build strong ones; let this 20% support the remaining 80%; let the whole civilization accelerate in positive feedback within perpetual construction.</strong></p><h2 id="iii-20-is-not-privilege-anti-elitist-design" tabindex="-1">III. 20% Is Not Privilege: Anti-Elitist Design <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-20-is-not-privilege-anti-elitist-design" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. 20% Is Not Privilege: Anti-Elitist Design&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The 20% Activation Strategy is most easily misread as &quot;cultivate 20% nobles.&quot; Heng Yuan Zhou structurally has anti-elitist design:</p><h3 id="_3-1-public-assessment" tabindex="-1">3.1 Public Assessment <a class="header-anchor" href="#_3-1-public-assessment" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;3.1 Public Assessment&quot;">​</a></h3><p>The 20% selection standards (four-dimensional assessment: Power 40 / Heart-Nature 25 / Contribution 20 / Responsibility 15) are all public; no back-room dealing.</p><h3 id="_3-2-mandatory-coverage" tabindex="-1">3.2 Mandatory Coverage <a class="header-anchor" href="#_3-2-mandatory-coverage" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;3.2 Mandatory Coverage&quot;">​</a></h3><p>This 20% must cover all major clans across Myriad Ranks&#39; five lineages; it may not concentrate in humankind, may not concentrate in some one race. If any major clan&#39;s share in the 20% is too low, the Guidance Post triggers special filling.</p><h3 id="_3-3-exit-mechanism" tabindex="-1">3.3 Exit Mechanism <a class="header-anchor" href="#_3-3-exit-mechanism" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;3.3 Exit Mechanism&quot;">​</a></h3><p>Strong ones who enter the 20% are not lifetime tenure. If their civilizational weight keeps declining and post performance does not meet standards, they are rotated out of the 20% sequence, and more suitable cultivators fill in. The 20% is a dynamic pool, not a fixed identity.</p><h3 id="_3-4-rights-guarantee-for-the-80" tabindex="-1">3.4 Rights Guarantee for the 80% <a class="header-anchor" href="#_3-4-rights-guarantee-for-the-80" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;3.4 Rights Guarantee for the 80%&quot;">​</a></h3><p>The remaining 80% of beings do not lose any rights for not being 20% — the Everyone-a-Road Guarantee System (Document 08) ensures every being has basic cultivation conditions; the 20% are only &quot;backbone,&quot; not &quot;masters.&quot;</p><h2 id="iv-the-historical-depth-of-the-20-activation-strategy" tabindex="-1">IV. The Historical Depth of the 20% Activation Strategy <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-the-historical-depth-of-the-20-activation-strategy" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. The Historical Depth of the 20% Activation Strategy&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The 20% Activation Strategy is not completed by one generation. It requires several generations of transcended ones relay:</p><ul><li>First-generation anchors: from 0 to 1;</li><li>Second-generation transcended ones: from 1% to 10%;</li><li>Third-generation transcended ones: from 10% to 20%;</li><li>Later transcended ones: maintain above 20%, push higher ratios.</li></ul><p>Every generation of transcended ones&#39; KPI includes &quot;the number of plane-transcendent strong ones he cultivated.&quot; This figure is the 20% Activation Strategy&#39;s generational relay baton. Lin Hao&#39;s generation passes the baton; the next generation keeps running — this is perpetual construction embodied in the time dimension.</p><h2 id="v-five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">V. Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: the 20% backbone ranks concentrate civilization&#39;s strongest computable power into perpetual construction, preventing strong-one idling</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: 20% selection is by contribution only, not by predation; predatory-faction strong ones cannot enter the backbone</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang-Luo-style elites are &quot;the protagonist leads a few disciples&quot;; Heng Yuan Zhou-style 20% is &quot;backbone selected by assessment from Myriad Ranks&quot; — the former relies on human feeling, the latter on institution</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: the 20% composition must cover 99% of clans; it is not a humankind club</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: selection standards, assessment processes, backbone lists are all public in the Selfless-Dao public library</li><li><strong>Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law</strong>: all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity — infinite origin inherent in all; predation naturally loses its meaning</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The 20% Activation Strategy is not cultivating 20% nobles; it is cultivating 20% builders. Their privilege is not enjoyment, but work; their reward is not private property, but a larger stage.</p><p>This strategy&#39;s most exquisite point is that it completely welds the two identities of &quot;strong one&quot; and &quot;builder.&quot; The old world&#39;s strong ones need not build — they obtained power by birth, by predation, by luck, with power decoupled from their contribution. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s 20% Activation Strategy welds the two from the moment of selection: you want to enter the 20%; you must pass four-dimensional assessment, must take a post, must accept Alaya supervision. After entering, you want to lie flat? The post-replacement procedure awaits. <strong>The stronger this 20% is, the wider the remaining 80%&#39;s uplift road — this is the final unity of perpetual construction and the 20% Activation Strategy.</strong></p><p>In the end, the perpetual construction and 20% Activation Strategy described in this entry is no isolated case — its causal and energetic traces are throughout filed in the Alaya Network, traceable and correctable.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/23-20％激活战略规划.html">Entry 23 · 20%-Activation Strategy Plan</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/75-20％激活战略实施.html">Entry 75 · 20%-Activation Strategy Implementation</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/17-位面至高强者标准.html">Entry 17 · Plane-Transcendent Strong-One Standards</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/08-人人有路保障体系.html">Entry 08 · Everyone-a-Road Guarantee System</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',41)])])}const g=t(o,[["render",r]]);export{p as __pageData,g as default};
